:: MP Loc School Hub [nobr]
<<set _sera to (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet) ? "塞拉" : "标本室的那个人")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>>
牛津街尽头的铁栅校门只开了一扇，门房窗台上搁着凉茶和访客簿。空气里混着粉笔灰、湿拖把和食堂煮卷心菜的味道。值日生抱着作业本挤过去，没人多看你一眼。<<if $mpLocProgress_School gte 3>>布告栏最上面的旧通知被风掀起，底下新贴的纸露出大半。<<elseif $mpLocProgress_School gte 1>>布告栏一角旧纸被掀开，露出下面稍新的一张。<<else>>布告栏最上面那张卷了边，底下的纸还压在下面。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $mpSchoolEnded>>旧馆的事已有定论：<<if $mpWorldSchoolOutcome is "openarchive">>卷宗公开，谁都能翻。<<else>>卷宗封存，借阅要签字。<</if>><<elseif $mpWorldSchoolOutcome is "openarchive">>旧馆的档案已经搬进阅览室，谁都能翻。<<elseif $mpWorldSchoolOutcome is "curated">>旧馆的卷宗被学会重新编号，借阅要两道签字。<</if>>
<br><br>
这栋楼不肯把事都摆在同一层。你抬脚往里走。
<br><br>
<<mpSchoolEventRoll "enter">>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回校门 (0:02)|School]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[去教室上课 (0:03)|MP Loc School Class]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<if (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18) and ($delinquency or 0) gte 3 and not ($mpDetentionDay is Time.days and $mpDetentionServed is 1)>><<mpcleanicon>><<link [[到留堂教室去 (0:03)|MP Loc School Detention]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去学园表层看看 (0:06)|MP Loc School Surface]]>><<pass 6>><</link>><br>
<<link [[翻看更多日常杂事 (0:03)|MP Loc School More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Surface [nobr]
<<set _leighton to (mpNpcMet("Leighton") ? "礼顿先生" : "教务处的老师")>><<set _whitney to (mpNpcMet("Whitney") ? "惠特尼" : "那个大孩子")>><<set _kylar to (mpNpcMet("Kylar") ? "凯拉尔" : "那个瘦小的学生")>><<set _robin to (mpNpcMet("Robin") ? "罗宾" : "食堂帮工的孩子")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set _choreOpen to ((Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18))>>
上午第二节课刚下，走廊像被谁拧开了阀门。学生从教室里涌出来，鞋底在打过蜡的木地板上打滑；尽头那间教室还飘着粉笔和旧课本的气味，水房传来拖把撞桶的钝响。人群里撞见几张脸：<<print _whitney>>靠在储物柜上踢柜门，<<print _robin>>抱着餐盘从食堂过来，<<print _kylar>>缩在窗台最里头看书，<<print _leighton>>夹着一叠纸往教务处去。走廊尽头的黑板今天格外脏，图书室的门虚掩着，像是在等谁去推。窗外操场上有人跑圈，哨声断断续续。你决定先做哪一件。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _choreOpen>><<investigateicon>><<link [[擦净黑板 (0:10)|MP Loc School Event 1]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">走廊黑板擦拭（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<if _choreOpen>><<mplettericon>><<link [[整理借阅台 (0:10)|MP Loc School Event 2]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">图书室借阅台（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[动身去学园中层 (0:06)|MP Loc School Mid]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.max($mpLocProgress_School, 1)>><</link>>
<br><<link [[到操场边看看天色 (0:06)|MP Loc School Season]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Mid [nobr]
<<set _noel to (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet) ? "诺艾尔" : "标本室的管理员")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set _choreOpen to ((Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18))>>
穿过走廊尽头的防火门，楼梯陡了一截，台阶边缘被几十届学生踩出浅凹。空气里有漆味、旧木头的霉味和理科教室飘出的醋酸；墙上钉着历年成绩榜和社团合影，照片里的人一年比一年整齐。这一层管着分数、课程表和社团场地，霸凌常发生在体育馆背风的墙根，老师经过时眼睛看着别处。<<print _noel>>抱着贴标签的玻璃罐从理科教室出来，看见你先打量脸色：「标本室今天要清点，缺人手。你要来，先洗……算了，我看你已经洗过了。」她往里走，门给你留着。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _choreOpen>><<investigateicon>><<link [[理科标本 (0:12)|MP Loc School Event 3]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">理科标本陈列（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<if _choreOpen>><<mpgearicon>><<link [[体育馆器材 (0:12)|MP Loc School Event 4]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">旧体育馆器材（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<sneakicon>><<if $mpLocProgress_School gte 2 or $mpLocEvents_School gte 2>><<link [[下到学园深层去 (0:08)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 8>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.max($mpLocProgress_School, 3)>><</link>><<else>><<link [[不管不顾往里闯 (0:08)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 8>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP Loc School Deep [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set _choreOpen to ((Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18))>>
铁门后面是没有窗的一段路。墙皮剥落处露出更早一层的砖，头顶的灯每隔几步才有一盏。越往里走声音越清楚：钟塔齿轮的闷响、锅炉蒸汽撞管道的回声、水珠砸在铁皮上的滴答。这里是学园真正的底子：学期安排、考试排名、礼堂后台的旧道具、雾潮停课的通知，都从这一层发出去。钟塔下的旧档案室门锁锈得厉害，锅炉暗廊的水位线一道比一道高，旧馆那批卷宗就摊在不远的推车上。推车旁站着两个别着学会铜章的人，谁都没先开口。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<link [[回中层看看 (0:04)|MP Loc School Mid]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br>
<<if _choreOpen>><<mplettericon>><<link [[走进钟塔旧档案室 (0:15)|MP Loc School Event 5]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">钟塔旧档案室（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<if _choreOpen>><<mpcellaricon>><<link [[去地下锅炉暗廊 (0:15)|MP Loc School Event 6]]>><<pass 15>><</link>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">地下锅炉暗廊（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<if $mpSchoolEnded>>
<<if $mpWorldSchoolOutcome is "openarchive">><<socialiseicon>><<link [[公开卷宗 (0:05)|MP Loc School Ending A]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>
<<else>><<link [[封存卷宗 (0:05)|MP Loc School Ending B]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<<elseif ($schoolrep or 0) gte 5 and ($delinquency or 0) lte 2>>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[公开档案 (0:20)|MP Loc School Ending A]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<<elseif ($schoolrep or 0) lte 0 or ($delinquency or 0) gte 5>>
<<link [[移交监管 (0:20)|MP Loc School Ending B]]>><<pass 20>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Loc School Season [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>>
时令是 <<if Time.season is "spring">>春<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>夏<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>秋<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>冬<<else>>当季<</if>>，天色是 <<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>有雨<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "snow">>有雪<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "none">>晴好<<else>>薄雾<</if>>。地下水跟着天气走，暗廊水线一天能挪两回。风大时旗绳整夜敲着旗杆，雨天走廊挂满湿外套；锅炉房烧得最凶，铁管烫手，地下那层却还是阴冷。
<br><br>
季节一变，作息也跟着变：冬天早晨教室里已经坐满，夏天下午的课拖得很晚，春秋值日生整天在开关窗之间来回。考试周整栋楼忽然安静，文化祭前后走廊又摆满摊子。
<br><br>
雨雾天里墙根的水渍会显出走向，晴天则适合绕围墙走一圈。你决定先做哪一件。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcloudicon>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain" or ($mpFogTide or 0) gte 3>><<link [[趁雨雾查迹 (0:12)|MP Loc School Event 4]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><<else>><<link [[晴日巡视 (0:12)|MP Loc School Event 1]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -2>><</link>><</if>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[转到学园表层去 (0:04)|MP Loc School Surface]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<br><<link [[翻看整本节历总览 (0:03)|MP Loc School Festival Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Event 1 [nobr]
<<set _leighton to (mpNpcMet("Leighton") ? "礼顿先生" : "教务处的老师")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set _choreOpen to ((Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18))>>
午休前的走廊空了一阵。尽头那块黑板还留着上一节课的板书：一道没解完的方程，半行被袖子抹花的日期，右下角一个歪斜的小人。板擦泡在浑水里，槽沿结着白碱。<<print _leighton>>从办公室出来，扫了黑板一眼：「放学前要清出来。写歪一个字，明天就有人来问我。」这块黑板记着谁被留下、谁被调班、哪间教室的暖气坏了；字一擦，消息就只剩口耳相传。也可以只把改过的课表抄进本子，费不了多少力气，却能看到当天真正要紧的消息。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园表层 (0:02)|MP Loc School Surface]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _choreOpen>><<investigateicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[擦净黑板 (0:12)|MP Loc School Surface]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[擦净黑板 (0:12)|MP Loc School Surface]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">整理值日黑板（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[抄课表变动 (0:12)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Event 2 [nobr]
<<set _noel to (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet) ? "诺艾尔" : "标本室的管理员")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set _choreOpen to ((Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18))>>
图书室在走廊西头，毛玻璃把光滤成旧象牙色。推门进去，先闻到纸、胶水和地板蜡的味道。借阅台后的管理员踮脚够最上层的还书箱，头也不回：「逾期的书卡在第二个抽屉，按班级分，别弄乱。」抽屉一拉开，卡片挤得发胀，有的边角卷起，有的被水浸过又晒干；日期写错一天，罚单就会落到不相干的人头上。柜子背后的书架上还夹着几张没归档的借书单。<<print _noel>>前阵子借过的一本植物图鉴里多了几行铅笔小字，写着某种根须的浸泡时辰。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园表层 (0:02)|MP Loc School Surface]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _choreOpen>><<mplettericon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 220 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[归档书卡 (0:12)|MP Loc School Surface]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[归档书卡 (0:12)|MP Loc School Surface]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">归档逾期书卡（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[查夹页批注 (0:12)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Event 3 [nobr]
<<set _noel to (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet) ? "诺艾尔" : "标本室的管理员")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set _choreOpen to ((Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18))>>
理科教室后面那间陈列室平时锁着，今天门开着一条缝。三面墙的玻璃柜里排满标本：泡在福尔马林里的蛇，钉在软木板上的蝶，切开的种子横截面像一枚枚小小的星图。柜子底层空了一格，标签还在，玻璃上留下一圈干净的圆印。<<print _noel>>站在长桌旁，袖口卷到手肘，正用镊子翻一片发黑的根须：「清点从左边开始，编号对柜子，缺的记在本子上。手稳一点，别把标签蹭掉。」册子上的登记停在去年冬天，之后是空白。角落里那台落灰的天平也缺了一枚砝码。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园中层 (0:02)|MP Loc School Mid]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _choreOpen>><<investigateicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[清点标本 (0:12)|MP Loc School Mid]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[清点标本 (0:12)|MP Loc School Mid]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">清点玻璃标本（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<mpscaleicon>><<link [[校准旧天平 (0:12)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Event 4 [nobr]
<<set _mason to (mpNpcMet("Mason") ? "梅森" : "泳池边的教练")>><<set _whitney to (mpNpcMet("Whitney") ? "惠特尼" : "那个大孩子")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set _choreOpen to ((Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18))>>
旧体育馆在操场东侧，屋顶的铅皮被风掀开过一角。器械间的门上是老式搭扣锁，锁鼻缠着生锈的铁丝。推开门，一股橡胶、汗和霉木头的混合气味涌出来：跳箱叠在墙角，肋木架缺了两根横杆，成卷的旧垫子靠墙立着。馆内另一头，<<print _whitney>>把一个小个子学生堵在跳箱后面，手里晃着对方的运动鞋；<<print _mason>>站在场边，脖子上挂着哨子，眼睛盯着地上的白线，没有吹哨，也没有走开。你可以清点储物柜，也可以检查地板暗格。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园中层 (0:02)|MP Loc School Mid]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _choreOpen>><<investigateicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[清点储物 (0:12)|MP Loc School Mid]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[清点储物 (0:12)|MP Loc School Mid]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">清点锁闭储物（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<mpveilicon>><<link [[查地板暗格 (0:12)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Event 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set _choreOpen to ((Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18))>>
钟塔的楼梯是石头的，转着圈往上，越走越窄。旧档案室在钟室下面一层，屋里没有窗，靠墙一排铁皮柜，柜顶堆着落满灰的卷宗，绳子捆着，绳结硬得像木头。建校志书摊在最上面的架子上，皮面裂开，露出底下发黄的纸芯；最早的几页记着捐地人的名字、第一批教员的数目、钟塔落成那天的天气。再往后翻，有些段落被墨水涂掉，有些页整张不见了，只剩参差的纸根。台灯的光圈很小，只够罩住一页纸。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园深层 (0:02)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _choreOpen>><<mplettericon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link [[翻阅志书 (0:12)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[翻阅志书 (0:12)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">翻阅建校志书（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[拼撕页目录 (0:12)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Event 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>><<set _choreOpen to ((Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13) or (Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18))>>
地下锅炉暗廊的入口在食堂后厨的杂物间后面，铁栅门虚掩着。往下走，温度一层层升上来，空气又湿又重，呼吸时能尝到铁锈味。锅炉本体在暗廊尽头，外壳包着石棉，接缝处噗噗地冒白汽；管道沿着穹顶铺开，像一堆盘起来的旧蛇。靠墙那侧的水位线一道比一道高，最新的那道还挂着水珠。铁栅后面另有一条更窄的通道，尽头是一扇封存的铁门，门缝里塞过麻絮，又被水泡得发黑。管道上的防爆灯被熏得发黄，光落在水面上，晃成一片碎金。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园深层 (0:02)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _choreOpen>><<mpgearicon>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 400>><<link [[排查阀门 (0:12)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to Math.min(5, $mpLocProgress_School + 1)>><<stress -3>><</link>><<else>><<link [[排查阀门 (0:12)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 12>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><</if>><br><<else>><span class="disabled">排查蒸汽阀门（午休 12–13 或放学 15–18）</span><br><</if>>
<<mpdooricon>><<link [[开封印铁门 (0:12)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 12>><<set $mpLocEvents_School += 1>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Ending A [nobr]
<<set _noel to (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet) ? "诺艾尔" : "标本室的管理员")>><<set _leighton to (mpNpcMet("Leighton") ? "礼顿先生" : "教务处的老师")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>>
<<set $mpSchoolEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldSchoolOutcome to "openarchive">><<set $mpLocProgress_School to 5>><<set $schoolrep to Math.max(0, ($schoolrep or 0) - 1)>>
旧馆的卷宗在一个没有课的下午搬进阅览室。卷宗按年份摊开，绳子剪断，硬纸封皮一掀，灰尘同时扬起来。消息传得比预想快：高年级的挤在门口看，老师来了，连食堂帮工都端着盆过来问。<<print _leighton>>站在人群外，脸色一阵白一阵青，最后只把纸边捏出一道深折痕。<<print _noel>>来得晚，站在窗边说：「原来那几年缺的标本，是这么没的。公开了也好。」往后那些纸不再锁在铁皮柜里，谁能翻、谁不能翻，也不再由某一个人决定。
<br><br>
<span class="red">校方记下了你这次越界，往后在教务处说话要多费些口舌。校誉 -1。</span>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回学园总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回学园深层 (0:04)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Ending B [nobr]
<<set _noel to (($mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.noel and $mpNpcs.noel.hasMet) ? "诺艾尔" : "标本室的管理员")>><<set _leighton to (mpNpcMet("Leighton") ? "礼顿先生" : "教务处的老师")>><<set _whitney to (mpNpcMet("Whitney") ? "惠特尼" : "那个大孩子")>><<set _kylar to (mpNpcMet("Kylar") ? "凯拉尔" : "那个瘦小的学生")>>
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>>
<<set $mpSchoolEnded to 1>><<set $mpWorldSchoolOutcome to "curated">><<set $mpLocProgress_School to 5>><<set $delinquency to Math.min(99, ($delinquency or 0) + 1)>>
学会的人来得很准时，三个人，两辆车，车上装着木箱和封条。卷宗就地清点：编上号，装进箱子，箱口贴上盖了铜章的纸条。<<print _leighton>>全程陪着，脸色比前几天松快；他给来人倒茶，又亲手搬上最后一箱：「这样最好，东西有人管，规矩也就立起来了。」车开走后，学会在门厅留下一张编号空着的收据。<<print _noel>>在标本室门口拦住你：「我数了箱子，比册子上记的少一箱。少的那箱，编号是最后几页的。」
<br><br>
<span class="red">有学生看见你站在学会的车旁，走廊里的招呼少了，违纪的帽子却更容易扣到你头上。违纪 +1。</span>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回学园总枢 (0:04)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -6>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回学园深层 (0:04)|MP Loc School Deep]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc School Class [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>>
<<set $schoolrep to ($schoolrep or 0)>><<set $delinquency to ($delinquency or 0)>><<set $schoolstate to ($schoolstate or 0)>>
<<set $mpSchoolClassCount to (Number($mpSchoolClassDay) is Number(Time.days) ? ($mpSchoolClassCount or 0) : 0)>><<set $mpSchoolClassDay to Time.days>>
<<set _schoolDay to (Time.weekDay gte 1 and Time.weekDay lte 5)>>
<<set _inClass to (_schoolDay and ((Time.hour gte 9 and Time.hour lt 12) or (Time.hour gte 13 and Time.hour lt 15)))>>
<<set _lunch to (Time.hour gte 12 and Time.hour lt 13)>>
<<set _period to (Time.hour gte 13 ? (Time.hour gte 14 ? 5 : 4) : (Time.hour gte 11 ? 3 : (Time.hour gte 10 ? 2 : 1)))>>
<<set _subject to ((_period is 2 or _period is 5) ? "english" : ((_period is 3) ? "science" : "maths"))>>
<<set _skill to ((_subject is "english") ? ($english or 0) : ((_subject is "science") ? ($science or 0) : ($maths or 0)))>>
<<set _subjName to ((_subject is "english") ? "文法" : ((_subject is "science") ? "自然" : "算术"))>>
<<if _inClass and $mpSchoolClassCount lt 5>>
这一节是第 <<print _period>> 节的 <<print _subjName>> 课。粉笔灰浮在窗光里，前排的笔记翻得哗哗响，后排有人把课本立起来挡着脸。你摊开练习册，先生讲的每一句都要当场记下；答不上来的时候，走廊尽头的钟会替你数着停顿。<<if Number($schoolstate) lte 0>>你的名字还不在册上，只能站在后排旁听。<<else>>先生点名时跳过了你，却把目光在你身上多停了一息。<</if>>
<<mpSchoolEventRoll "break">>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[认真听课 (1:00)|MP Loc School Class]]>><<pass 60>><<set $mpSchoolClassDay to Time.days>><<set $mpSchoolClassCount to ($mpSchoolClassCount or 0) + 1>><<set $schoolrep to Math.min(100, ($schoolrep or 0) + 1)>><<set $delinquency to Math.max(0, ($delinquency or 0) - 1)>><<stress -1>><<if _skill gte 200>><<set $schoolrep to Math.min(100, $schoolrep + 1)>><span class="green">你把先生的板书和例题都记了下来，答问时没有卡壳。校誉 +1。</span><<else>><<set $schoolrep to Math.max(-5, $schoolrep - 2)>><<stress 2>><span class="red">有一道题你没跟上，先生的粉笔在讲台上敲了两下。校誉净 -1。</span><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[翘掉这节课 (1:00)|MP Loc School Class]]>><<pass 60>><<set $mpSchoolClassDay to Time.days>><<set $mpSchoolClassCount to ($mpSchoolClassCount or 0) + 1>><<set $delinquency to Math.min(99, ($delinquency or 0) + 1)>><<set $schoolrep to Math.max(-5, ($schoolrep or 0) - 1)>><<stress 1>><span class="red">你从后门溜了出去，值日生把你的空位记在了考勤表上。违纪 +1，校誉 -1。</span><</link>>
<<elseif _lunch>>
午休的铃一响，走廊立刻被人潮填满。食堂的餐车从后门推上来，热气在冷空气里翻成白雾；教室这边却安静下来，几张课桌拼在一起，有人趴着补觉，有人翻着下午的课本。你还有一刻钟可以喘口气，下午的课一点准时开始。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[午休打个盹 (1:00)|MP Loc School Class]]>><<pass 60>><<stress -2>><<tiredness -1>><<set $mpSchoolClassDay to Time.days>><</link>>
<<elseif _schoolDay and Time.hour gte 6 and Time.hour lt 9>>
校门刚开，走廊里还带着夜里的凉气。值日生拖着水桶从你身边过去，教室的门一扇扇打开，早读的声音还没起来。第一节课九点开始，来早了只能在门厅里等，或者翻翻昨天没看完的课本。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if not ($daily and $daily.mpSchoolWait is Time.days)>><<mplettericon>><<link [[翻翻旧课本 (0:10)|MP Loc School Class]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpSchoolWait to Time.days>><<stress -1>><</link>><<else>><<mplettericon>><<link [[在门厅等到上课 (0:10)|MP Loc School Class]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><</if>>
<<elseif _inClass>>
五节课都已经过去了，教室的灯关了一半，黑板上只剩值日生没擦净的边角。你把课本收进包里，走廊里的人在往校门走，钟塔的指针已经越过放学的刻度。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去操场边 (0:06)|MP Loc School Season]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<<else>>
今天没有课。教室的门锁着，窗帘拉了一半，走廊里只有门房拖地的声音。操场那边偶尔传来哨响，钟塔照常报时，学园的日子按钟点走，错过这一节就只能等下一个上学的日子。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去操场边 (0:06)|MP Loc School Season]]>><<pass 6>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Loc School Detention [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_School to ($mpLocProgress_School or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_School to ($mpLocEvents_School or 0)>>
<<set $mpDetentionServed to (Number($mpDetentionDay) is Number(Time.days) ? ($mpDetentionServed or 0) : 0)>><<set $mpDetentionDay to Time.days>>
<<set $delinquency to ($delinquency or 0)>><<set $schoolrep to ($schoolrep or 0)>><<set $detention to ($detention or 0)>>
<<set _canDetain to ((Time.weekDay gte 1 and Time.weekDay lte 5) and Time.hour gte 15 and Time.hour lt 18 and $delinquency gte 3 and $mpDetentionServed is 0)>>
<<if _canDetain>>
放学的铃已经响过，走廊里的人散得很快，只有留堂教室的灯还亮着。黑板上写着一行抄写范围，讲台边摆着一摞裁好的纸和一支蘸水笔。先生把名册翻到你的名字，指尖在违纪次数上停了一下：「规矩写在那儿，抄完再走。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[留下抄写 (1:00)|MP Loc School Detention]]>><<pass 60>><<set $detention to ($detention or 0) + 1>><<set $delinquency to Math.max(0, ($delinquency or 0) - 2)>><<set $mpDetentionServed to 1>><<stress 2>><span class="green">你把抄写交上去，先生核过遍数，在名册上划了一道。留堂记录 +1，违纪 -2。</span><</link>><br>
<<mplettericon>><<link [[甩下笔就走 (0:10)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 10>><<set $delinquency to Math.min(99, ($delinquency or 0) + 2)>><<set $schoolrep to Math.max(-5, ($schoolrep or 0) - 2)>><<stress 2>><span class="red">你拉开教室门走了出去，先生没有追，只在名册上又添了一笔。违纪 +2，校誉 -2。</span><</link>>
<<else>>
留堂教室的灯亮着，门却从里面锁上了。名册摊在讲台上，今天这一栏已经画过线；走廊尽头传来门房锁校门的声音。今天没有再要你留下的事，回总枢去吧。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回学园总枢 (0:02)|MP Loc School Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去学园表层看看 (0:04)|MP Loc School Surface]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Widgets MP School Event [widget nobr]
<<widget "mpSchoolEventRoll">>
	<<set _slot to (String(_args[0] || "enter") is "break" ? "mpSchoolBreak" : "mpSchoolEnter")>>
	<<set _day to (window.Time ? Time.days : 0)>>
	<<if not ($daily and $daily[_slot] is _day)>>
		<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
		<<set $daily[_slot] to _day>>
		<<set _roll to random(1, 100)>>
		<<if _roll lte 24>>
			<br><span class="blue">【迟到】</span>校门的铁栅已经合上一半，走廊里传来第一遍铃声。你贴着墙根往里走，鞋底在光亮的木地板上打滑，回声一路追到楼梯口。
			<<if (($athletics or 0) gte 200 or random(1, 100) lte 55)>>
				你赶在先生转身之前溜进后门，没人抬头。<<stress 1>>
			<<else>>
				值日生把你的名字记在门边的小本上，先生隔着讲台看了你一眼。<<set $delinquency to ($delinquency or 0) + 1>><<set $schoolrep to Math.max(-5, ($schoolrep or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><span class="red">违纪 +1，校誉 -1。</span>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _roll lte 44>>
			<br><span class="blue">【告状】</span>两个学生堵在楼梯口，说昨天走廊上的事是你起的头。围观的人越聚越多，谁也没把话说明白。
			<<if (($english or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or random(1, 100) lte 45)>>
				你把前后经过讲清楚，先生摆摆手让众人散了。<<stress 1>>
			<<else>>
				话传到教务处时已经变了样，先生在你的名字旁画了个圈。<<set $schoolrep to Math.max(-5, ($schoolrep or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><span class="red">校誉 -1。</span>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _roll lte 64>>
			<br><span class="blue">【争执】</span>操场边的两个人从推搡变成扭打，书包甩在地上，围观的人自动让出一圈。
			<<if (($physique or 0) gte 3000 or ($willpower or 0) gte 350 or random(1, 100) lte 40)>>
				你挤进去把两个人分开，顺手把书包踢还给主人。<<stress 1>>
			<<else>>
				你被卷进人堆，等先生赶来时，三个人一起被记了名。<<set $delinquency to ($delinquency or 0) + 1>><<stress 2>><span class="red">违纪 +1。</span>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif _roll lte 84>>
			<br><span class="blue">【偶遇】</span>图书室最里面那排书架后有人影。<<if mpNpcMet("Noel")>>诺艾尔抱着一摞标本册，正踮脚够最上层的书。<<elseif mpNpcMet("Lin")>>林恩把一本旧地图摊在窗台上，手指压着折角。<<elseif mpNpcMet("Monet")>>莫奈靠在书架边，翻着一本边角起毛的账册。<<else>>管理员在梯子上整理书脊，听见脚步也没回头。<</if>>
			<<if mpNpcMet("Noel") or mpNpcMet("Lin") or mpNpcMet("Monet")>>
				对方替你抽出够不着的书，又低声说了两句旧馆的事。<<set $schoolrep to Math.min(100, ($schoolrep or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><span class="green">校誉 +1。</span>
			<<else>>
				你在书架间转了一圈，只找到一本被翻烂的旧课本。<<set $schoolrep to Math.max(-5, ($schoolrep or 0) - 1)>><<stress 1>><span class="red">校誉 -1。</span>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<br><span class="blue">【积水】</span>雨水把门厅前的砖地浸得反光，几步远的地方积了一汪水。学生踮着脚从边上绕，有人踩翻木板，溅起一片。
			<<if (($athletics or 0) gte 200 or random(1, 100) lte 50)>>
				你踩着干处绕过去，裤脚只湿了一点。<<stress -1>>
			<<else>>
				你一脚踩进水里，鞋袜全湿，走到教室时地上留下一串水印。<<set $schoolrep to Math.max(-5, ($schoolrep or 0) - 1)>><<stress 2>><span class="red">校誉 -1。</span>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>
